      "id": "th-cambodia-border",
      "country": "TH",
      "topic": "safety",
      "title": "Cambodian border: red 0–5 km, orange 5–20 km",
      "body": "Ceasefire since late 2025 but unpredictable; the border is closed, with army checkpoints and possible landmines.",
      "severity": "critical",
      "sources": [
        {
          "title": "Reisadvies Thailand — NederlandWereldwijd",
          "url": "https://www.nederlandwereldwijd.nl/reisadvies/thailand"
