    },
    {
      "id": "th-scooter-scam",
      "country": "TH",
      "topic": "safety",
      "title": "Scooter rental scams",
      "body": "Never hand over your passport or licence as a deposit (Thai authorities ban it) — give a copy or a cash deposit. Film the scooter before riding; lock it when parked. Many rental scooters are uninsured.",
      "severity": "important",
      "sources": [
        {
          "title": "Reisadvies Thailand — NederlandWereldwijd",
          "url": "https://www.nederlandwereldwijd.nl/reisadvies/thailand"
        }
      ],
      "verifiedAt": "2026-09-30"
    },
    {
      "id": "th-traffic",
      "country": "TH",
      "topic": "safety",
      "title": "Deadly roads; unsafe buses and ferries",
      "body": "Thousands of road deaths a year, mostly on scooters. Almost all scooters are officially motorbikes: without a valid (international) motorcycle licence your travel insurance often won't pay. Buses and ferries are often poorly maintained; ferries overcrowded with too few life jackets.",
      "severity": "critical",
      "sources": [
        {
          "title": "Reisadvies Thailand — NederlandWereldwijd",
          "url": "https://www.nederlandwereldwijd.nl/reisadvies/thailand"
        }
      ],
      "verifiedAt": "2026-09-30"
    },
    {
      "id": "th-job-scams",
      "country": "TH",
      "topic": "safety",
      "title": "Fake job offers",
      "body": "Foreigners are lured with well-paid jobs and then trafficked into forced labour in neighbouring countries.",
      "sources": [
        {
          "title": "Reisadvies Thailand — NederlandWereldwijd",
