      "country": "TH",
      "topic": "weather",
      "title": "Rainy season May–October",
      "body": "May–October nationwide; October–January also in the south and the south-east coast (Surat Thani and further south, Koh Tao, Koh Pha Ngan, Koh Samui). Floods can cut power, phone and roads.",
